# Server layer boundaries

Full guide: `docs/architecture.md`.

| Layer | Put here |
|-------|----------|
| `models/*.server.ts` | Prisma + domain rules for a bounded context |
| `services/` | Pure computation / scoring (no direct DB I/O) |
| `utils/**/*.server.ts` | Auth, CSRF, email, sanitization, infra |
| `lib/queries/` + `lib/mutations/` | Browser fetch + TanStack Query keys |
| `app/api/**` | Auth → validate → delegate to models/services → HTTP map |

API routes should stay thin. Do not import `models/*.server.ts` from client query modules.
